  "title": "NUTEX HEALTH RESPONDS TO SHORT SELLER REPORT",
  "summary": "HOUSTON, Nov. 26, 2025 /PRNewswire/ — Nutex Health Inc. (“Nutex Health” or the “Company”) (NASDAQ: NUTX), is aware of a short seller report issued on November 25, 2025 by Capybara Research. Based on publicly available information, Capybara Research as an entity seems not to exist. In the past, lawsuits filed against Capybara by other victims […]",
